---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
const photoPath = `${baseUrl}images/ahsan.webp`;
const fallbackPhotoPath = `${baseUrl}images/ahsan.jpg`;
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 md:py-28 border-b border-border-subtle bg-bg-base">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="space-y-12">
      <!-- Section Header -->
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-accent">
          <span>01</span>
          <span class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-accent/40"></span>
          <span class="tracking-widest uppercase">ABOUT &amp; PROFILE</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary">
          Operations Foundation, Cloud Direction
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Grid: Photo + Narrative -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        <!-- Portrait Image Column (4 cols) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col items-center sm:items-start">
          <div class="relative group w-64 sm:w-72 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-border-subtle bg-bg-surface p-2 shadow-sm">
            <picture>
              <source srcset={photoPath} type="image/webp" />
              <img
                src={fallbackPhotoPath}
                alt="Ahsan Ahmad Siddiqui - Software Engineer"
                class="w-full h-80 object-cover rounded-xl filter grayscale contrast-105 group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-300"
                width="288"
                height="320"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </picture>

            <!-- Operational Spec Tag -->
            <div class="mt-2.5 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-bg-subtle border border-border-subtle flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-text-tertiary">
              <span class="text-text-secondary">AHSAN_SIDDIQUI</span>
              <span class="text-accent">MOBILY_INFOTECH</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Narrative Column (8 cols) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6">
          <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-5 text-base sm:text-lg text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Early-career Software Engineer at <strong class="text-text-primary font-semibold">Mobily Infotech</strong> in Bengaluru with <strong class="text-text-primary font-semibold">~2 years of hands-on experience</strong> in enterprise systems operations, automation, and release support.
            </p>
            <p>
              Having started as an IT Operations Intern and earned a promotion to Software Engineer, I focus on eliminating manual toil through shell scripting, optimizing Oracle SQL queries, and maintaining high platform reliability.
            </p>
            <p>
              Passionate about modern DevOps practices, I continuously build hands-on cloud projects utilizing AWS, Terraform, Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD, and full-stack observability.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Operating Principles Callouts -->
          <div class="pt-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-bg-surface border border-border-subtle space-y-2 card-hover">
              <div class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider">01. Eliminate Toil</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
                Repetitive CLI work should be parallelized, tested, and automated with strict idempotency and validation.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-bg-surface border border-border-subtle space-y-2 card-hover">
              <div class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider">02. Platform Reliability</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
                24/7 on-call readiness, deep-dive root cause analyses (RCA), and proactive database capacity detection.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-bg-surface border border-border-subtle space-y-2 card-hover">
              <div class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider">03. Modern GitOps</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
                Declarative Terraform infrastructure, immutable commit-SHA containers, Canary shifting, and 17s DR.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
